### cr201-fault-recovery-stays-immediate 
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 delay_normal=100 escalate=0
init 0
sf 0 20
s 10 20
---
cfg
NORMAL
FAULT TO_FAULT@0:20.000
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@10:20.000
### cr203-acked-suppressed-in-maintenance
