### cr203-acked-carries-fault-sample-value
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 10 35
s 20 nan
ack 30
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@10:35.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@20:nan
FAULT ACKED@30:nan
### cr203-return-to-normal-keeps-episode-unacked
